        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Schreiber Foods, Forbes\n- Places: Port Plaza Mall\n- Topics: annual sales, private employer ranking, publishing, redevelopment\n\nFacts:\n- Forbes is published bi-weekly and features original articles on finance, industry, investing, and marketing topics.\n- In 2012, the Port Plaza Mall property was razed during the first half of the year as part of a redevelopment project.\n- Schreiber Foods headquarters now stands on the main footprint of the former Port Plaza Mall.\n- In 2016, Forbes ranked Schreiber Foods as the 81st largest private employer.\n- Schreiber Foods had more than $5 billion in annual sales when Forbes gave that 2016 ranking.",
